  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A wall of thorns (up to 60 ft long, or a 20-ft circle) that blocks sight. Creatures in it when it appears make a DEX save: 7d8 Piercing, half on a success. Moving through costs 4 ft per foot, and a creature entering it or ending its turn there makes a DEX save: 7d8 Slashing, half on a success, once per turn. Both +1d8 per slot level above 6th.</p>",
